:level-1
    a               skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme   acqf-qcp-model:zw-nqf-levels ;
    skos:prefLabel  "Level 1"@en ;
    skos:altLabel   "Primary Level Certificate"@en ;
    skos:notation   "ZNQF-1" ;
    skos:definition """
- Rudimentary knowledge
- Relate elementary techniques to mastery and mathematical ability including desirable values
- Work under intermittent guidance, consistent scrutiny and limited autonomy
"""
.

:level-2
    a               skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme   acqf-qcp-model:zw-nqf-levels ;
    skos:prefLabel  "Level 2"@en ;
    skos:altLabel   "Ordinary Level Certificate"@en ;
    skos:notation   "ZNQF-2" ;
    skos:definition """
- Broad-based knowledge
- Relate basic procedures and techniques
- Work in a controlled atmosphere, under direct supervision
"""
.

:level-3
    a               skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme   acqf-qcp-model:zw-nqf-levels ;
    skos:prefLabel  "Level 3"@en ;
    skos:altLabel   "General Advanced Level Certificate"@en ;
    skos:notation   "ZNQF-3" ;
    skos:definition """
- In-depth knowledge in specific subject areas
- Relate series of techniques in the field of study, to resolve challenges in broad circumstances
- Function under general supervision
"""
.

:level-4
    a               skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme   acqf-qcp-model:zw-nqf-levels ;
    skos:prefLabel  "Level 4"@en ;
    skos:altLabel   "National Certificate"@en ;
    skos:notation   "ZNQF-4" ;
    skos:definition """
- Operational knowledge in the area of specialty
- Relate diverse of techniques in the area of specialty, to get to the bottom recognisable problems in moderately usual settings
- Work under general supervision
"""
.

:level-5
    a               skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme   acqf-qcp-model:zw-nqf-levels ;
    skos:prefLabel  "Level 5"@en ;
    skos:altLabel   "National Diploma"@en ;
    skos:notation   "ZNQF-5" ;
    skos:definition """
- Comprehensive knowledge in the area of specialty
- Relate wide-ranging procedures, to work out real problems, in non-routine situations
- work under broad supervision
"""
.

:level-6
    a               skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme   acqf-qcp-model:zw-nqf-levels ;
    skos:prefLabel  "Level 6"@en ;
    skos:altLabel   "HND"@en ;
    skos:notation   "ZNQF-6" ;
    skos:definition """
- Work within wide-ranging self-sufficiency
- Specialised knowledge in the area of specialty
- Relate various and specific methods in the area of specialty entailing elementary investigation
- Work within wide-range of structures and a specific self-sufficiency
"""
.


:level-7
    a               skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme   acqf-qcp-model:zw-nqf-levels ;
    skos:prefLabel  "Level 7"@en ;
    skos:altLabel   "General Degree"@en ;
    skos:notation   "ZNQF-7" ;
    skos:definition """
- Comprehensive knowledge in the area of specialty
- Apply recognized tenets, calling for a wide range of information to work out challenges in diverse settings
"""
.

:level-8
    a               skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme   acqf-qcp-model:zw-nqf-levels ;
    skos:prefLabel  "Level 8"@en ;
    skos:altLabel   "Honours Degree"@en ;
    skos:notation   "ZNQF-8" ;
    skos:definition """
- Methodical comprehension of strategic facets area of specialty
- Implement precisely analysis and enquiry procedures within the area of specialty
- Work out setbacks using thoughts and methods in their area of specialty
- Work within wide-ranging self-sufficiency
"""
.

:level-9
    a               skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme   acqf-qcp-model:zw-nqf-levels ;
    skos:prefLabel  "Level 9"@en ;
    skos:altLabel   "Master Post Graduate"@en ;
    skos:notation   "ZNQF-9" ;
    skos:definition """
- Mastery of knowledge in the field of study
- Analysis of complex issues and research proposing solutions based on critical thinking
- Participate in resource management and supervision of others
- In-depth expert knowledge in the field of study
- Specialised skills and principles based on systematic scrutiny of information
- Function within wide-ranging independence
"""
.

:level-10
    a               skos:Concept ;
    skos:inScheme   acqf-qcp-model:zw-nqf-levels ;
    skos:prefLabel  "Level 10"@en ;
    skos:altLabel   "PhD"@en ;
    skos:notation   "ZNQF-10" ;
    skos:definition """
- Cutting edge research and creation of new knowledge in the development of the study
- Advance new techniques, ideas or approaches
- Autonomous in research conducted
"""
.
